* STATUS (R3 exploration A, final bounded refinement under amendments A6-A8, 2026-10-31): driver candidate.
* drv_Q1 = drv_z7 with three existing values changed: Cc 3.8 -> 5 pF, CO 3 -> 4 pF (noise), NMOS mirror cascodes
* XM15/XM16 m 7 -> 12 and their bias diode XM22 L 2.8 -> 2.5 um (XM16 saturation at ss/1.60/-40).
* Supplies 1.60/1.80/1.95 V, 45 conditions. Supply 782 uA at tt (617-977 uA over PVT).
* Sampled noise (repository noise.py, 45 x {0.6, 1.2} V): worst 138.7 uV rms (ff/1.95/125, 1.2 V).
* R_S <= 0.062 mV; stability.py PM >= 66.1 deg, GM >= 14.4 dB; primary screens (tight numerics):
* charge-free 1 kOhm <= 0.149 LSB, boot() W 5 um <= 0.133 LSB. Saturation >= 50 mV except the native input pair at
* sf/1.60/125, 1.2 V input (XM2 31 mV, XM1 33 mV): explained exception, see report Section 11.
* STRESS timing (diagnostic, A6): 1.9-7.3 LSB with boot() at tt and hot low-VDD points.
* Ideal elements (poly-R / MIM in layout): Rz 0.3 kOhm, Cc 5 pF, CO 4 pF (output to vss), RF1-RF5 100 kOhm,
* CF1-CF5 2 pF (bias-line RC filters). Report: the design-study record.
.subckt drv_Q1 vcmd fb out ibias vdd vss
* reference (Iref = 10 uA sunk into ibias) and NMOS bias sinks, 10 uA each
XM8  ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=4 L=1 m=1
XM18 vbp   ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=4 L=1 m=1
XM21 vbpc  ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=4 L=1 m=1
* PMOS bias: vbp diode; PMOS copies feeding the vbnc diode and the output-sink diode; vbpc diode
XM17 vbp   vbp   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt W=20 L=0.5 m=1
XM20 vbnc  vbp   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt W=20 L=0.5 m=1
XM22 vbnc  vbnc  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=1 L=2.5 m=1
XM19 vbpc  vbpc  vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt W=1.65 L=1 m=1
XM23 ib2   vbp   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt W=20 L=0.5 m=1
XM24 ib2   ib2   vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=2.5 L=4 m=1
* tail and native-threshold input pair
XM5  tail  ibt   vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=4 L=1 m=17
